      "description": "One supplied professor fixture with initials, a save action, profile link and illustrative rating.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-professor-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-row\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">SC</span><button class=\"ds-save\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Save Dr. Sarah Chen\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg>Save</button></div><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">Dr. Sarah Chen</h2><p class=\"ds-university\">Eastbridge University</p><p class=\"ds-expertise\">Machine learning · Python · Research</p><a class=\"ds-card-action\" href=\"#sarah-profile\">View profile <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ds-rating\" title=\"Illustrative preview ratings\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 7 .9-5.1 5 1.2 7-6.2-3.3-6.2 3.3 1.2-7-5.1-5 7-.9z\"/></svg><strong>4.9 / 5</strong><span>(24 reviews)</span></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-professor-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e3ec);padding:24px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Aptos, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#23243a);transition:border-color .15s}.ds-professor-card:hover{border-color:#b8a9e8}.ds-card-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.ds-avatar{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--purple,#6046d8);background:var(--soft,#f0ecfc)}.ds-save{border:0;background:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:var(--muted,#6c6c80);font-family:Aptos, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:12px;padding:6px;cursor:pointer}.ds-save[aria-pressed=true]{color:var(--purple,#6046d8)}.ds-card-title{font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:21px 0 5px}.ds-university{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#6c6c80);margin:0}.ds-expertise{font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 20px;line-height:1.6;min-height:41px}.ds-card-action{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;padding:11px 20px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:Aptos, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;transition:background .15s,box-shadow .15s,transform .15s;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;background:var(--purple,#6046d8);color:#fff;margin-top:auto}.ds-card-action:hover{background:#5137c4;text-decoration:none}.ds-card-action:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-rating{font-size:12px;color:#986017;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;margin-top:16px}.ds-rating svg{color:#ad762b}.ds-save:focus-visible,.ds-card-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9c8be8;outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-professor-card,.ds-card-action{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "30-minute Time Slots",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "time-slot",
      "description": "Available and selected meeting starts; selected state carries an explicit pressed value.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-slots\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"30-minute start times, Pacific time\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-time-slot\" aria-pressed=\"false\">9:00 AM</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-time-slot ds-time-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">9:30 AM</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-time-slot\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10:00 AM</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;max-height:280px;overflow:auto;padding:3px}.ds-time-slot{min-width:0;border:1px solid #ddd5f3;background:#fff;color:var(--purple,#6046d8);border-radius:7px;min-height:43px;font-family:Aptos, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer}.ds-time-slot:hover{background:var(--soft,#f0ecfc)}.ds-time-selected{background:var(--purple,#6046d8);border-color:var(--purple,#6046d8);color:#fff}.ds-time-selected:hover{background:var(--purple,#6046d8);color:#fff}.ds-time-slot:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9c8be8;outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-slots{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-slots{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The FacultyConnect application",
    "overview": "Preserve the supplied presentation's application area: white navigation, a pale neutral page, purple actions, initial avatars and clear meeting statuses. The visual character is restrained and spacious. Meeting details and the next action lead the page.\n\nThis document records the implemented frontend from [PRODUCT.md](PRODUCT.md), [global styles](src/styles.css), [management styles](src/features/management.css), the application components and the desktop/mobile captures in [.impeccable/review](.impeccable/review). It is a source-derived manual record. The Impeccable context engine and detector were unavailable; no engine extraction or detector verdict is claimed. Token values in the frontmatter are normative; the sidecar extends them with interaction and layout metadata. Its synthesized tonal ramps are display metadata rather than additional application colors.",
